msgid "For this purpose MULTIPLEX offers the plug-and-play `PC-cable # 85149 <https://www.multiplex-rc.de/produkte/85149-usb-pc-kabel-rx-s-telemetrie-uni>`__ which contains a SILABS CP2102 Single-chip USB to UART Bridge."
